US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">”</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">를 인식</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">하여 자살위험에 처한 친구들에게 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">지속적으로 관심</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">을 가지고 그들이 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">적절한</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">&nbsp;전문서비스 받도록 연결</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">하는</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">역할을 하는 것입니다</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">. </span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-fareast-fon